            "text": "Takes \u2014 Blend Transition Demo\n\nDemonstrates smooth blending between takes.\n\n1. Capture Base with the current orange animated scene\n2. Change albedo_color, count, spacing, roughness etc.\n3. Capture as 'Look B'\n4. Use the Blend slider to smoothly interpolate\n   between Base and 'Look B'\n\nFloat, int, Color, and Vector parameters interpolate.\nOther types snap at 50% blend.",
